{"meta":{"id":"servlet-context","category":"it/syntax/spring/setup","title":"servlet-context.xml (화면 경로 · 정적 파일) · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"ViewResolver prefix + return + suffix, resources 매핑, component-scan","tags":["spring","f-config","f-navigation"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">servlet-context.xml (화면 경로 · 정적 파일) · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> ViewResolver prefix + return + suffix, resources 매핑, component-scan</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">servlet-context.xml</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">xml</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;beans:beans ...&gt;\r\n  &lt;annotation-driven /&gt;                                          &lt;!-- @Controller 등 어노테이션 사용 --&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;resources mapping=&quot;/resources/**&quot; location=&quot;/resources/&quot; /&gt;   &lt;!-- 정적 파일 (css, js, 이미지) --&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;!-- 화면 경로: prefix + return 값 + suffix --&gt;\r\n  &lt;beans:bean class=&quot;org.springframework.web.servlet.view.InternalResourceViewResolver&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;beans:property name=&quot;prefix&quot; value=&quot;/WEB-INF/views/&quot; /&gt;\r\n    &lt;beans:property name=&quot;suffix&quot; value=&quot;.jsp&quot; /&gt;\r\n  &lt;/beans:bean&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;context:component-scan base-package=&quot;com.spring.sExam&quot; /&gt;    &lt;!-- 이 패키지 아래 @Controller 검색 --&gt;\r\n&lt;/beans:beans&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정리</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">컨트롤러가 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>return &quot;atom/a1&quot;;</code> 하면 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>/WEB-INF/views/atom/a1.jsp</code> 로 이동</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">resources: 주소는 mapping(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>/resources/**</code>), 실제 위치는 location(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>webapp/resources/</code>)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">주소에 / 가 연속으로 적혀도(//) 하나의 / 로 인식된다</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/setup/servlet-context","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"setup","title":"기본 연결 · 설정","path":"it/syntax/spring/setup"}],"hasImage":false}